[2026-02-04T00:15:24.275Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Execute this requirement immediately without asking questions.\n\n## REQUIREMENT\n\n# Debounced Search with Stable Filter Dependencies\n\n## Metadata\n- **Category**: performance\n- **Effort**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Impact**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Scan Type**: perf_optimizer\n- **Generated**: 2/1/2026, 11:43:15 PM\n\n## Description\nImplement debounced search input (150ms) in FindingsTab.tsx and SourcesTab.tsx where filterFindings runs on every keystroke. Additionally, stabilize the findings array dependency in useMemo by comparing array identity only when data actually changes (using a previousRef pattern or moving filtering into a dedicated useFilteredData hook). This prevents re-filtering when parent re-renders with the same underlying data.\n\n## Reasoning\nCurrently, typing 'machine learning' triggers 16 full filter operations instead of 1-2. Combined with unstable array references from parent renders, users experience 100ms+ input lag. Debouncing is a quick win that makes search feel instant, and stable dependencies prevent phantom re-renders that waste CPU cycles.\n\n\n## Recommended Skills\n\nUse Claude Code skills as appropriate for implementation guidance. Check `.claude/skills/` directory for available skills.\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an AI-evaluated project idea. No specific goal is associated with this idea.\n\n## AFTER IMPLEMENTATION\n\n1. Log your implementation using the `log_implementation` MCP tool with:\n   - requirementName: the requirement filename (without .md)\n   - title: 2-6 word summary\n   - overview: 1-2 paragraphs describing what was done\n\n2. Verify: `npx tsc --noEmit` (fix any type errors)\n\nBegin implementation now."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d184f0d2-244e-457f-8ea5-4627f2d647f1","uuid":"63a4c62a-b64d-4291-b5db-9120a2e4a7b8","isSynthetic":true}
